      "body": "网址：https://image2pixel.app/\n\nGithub 地址：https://github.com/JobYu/image2pixel-web\n\n简介：\n\n- 无服务器存储，用户隐私100%安全\n- 所见即所得，支持开启网格\n- 支持2个参数：像素尺寸和颜色数量\n- 支持保存图片和打印图片\n\n![](https://github.com/JobYu/image2pixel-web/raw/main/web/o1.PNG)\n![](https://github.com/JobYu/image2pixel-web/raw/main/web/r1.PNG)\n\n![](https://github.com/JobYu/image2pixel-web/raw/main/web/o2.PNG)\n![](https://github.com/JobYu/image2pixel-web/raw/main/web/r2.PNG)\n\n![](https://github.com/JobYu/image2pixel-web/raw/main/web/o3.png)\n![](https://github.com/JobYu/image2pixel-web/raw/main/web/r3.PNG)",
